  "title": {
    "en": "yggizz DSH plugins",
    "zh": "yggizz DSH 插件"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Small, dependency-free DeepSeek Harness plugins: a seven-feature suite with per-feature switches, a profile pack/restore panel, a sidebar restart control, and Chinese approval cards.",
    "zh": "一组无依赖的小插件：一个带逐项开关的七合一插件套件、一个 profile 打包迁移面板、一个侧栏重启按钮，以及审批界面中文。"
  },
