      "name": "@yggizz/dsh-sync-panel",
      "title": {
        "en": "Sync & migrate",
        "zh": "同步与迁移"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Pack or restore local plugins and DSH config from Settings: pick only local plugins, market plugins, plugin configs, DSH config, plugin switches or agent presets; link paths are rewritten and deps reinstalled as needed.",
        "zh": "设置页里一键打包 / 还原本地插件与 DSH 配置：可勾选只带本地插件、插件市场插件、插件配置、DSH 配置、插件开关或 Agent 预设，还原时自动改写 link 路径并按需重装依赖。"
      },
